Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?diag(uefi):=20=E6=91=98=E5=BD=95=E9=94=9A?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=88=B0=E4=BA=A4=E6=8E=A5=E7=9A=84=20arm=3D=20=E4=B8=8E=20ent?=
 =?UTF-8?q?er=20=E4=B8=A4=E8=A1=8C?=
